A NOTE ON THE DELIBERATELY VULNERABLE CODE

Parts of this repository are insecure ON PURPOSE — they are the exercise.
labs/week*/, labs/toolbox/ and project/starter-app/ contain outdated
dependencies, root containers, planted secrets and working injection flaws so
that students can find and fix them.

The MIT licence's "AS IS", no-warranty terms above apply to that code as they do
to everything else, and they are meant literally here: do not deploy any of it,
do not copy patterns out of it into real systems, and do not run it anywhere it
can be reached from an untrusted network.
